<MudText Class="mx-4 px-4 mt-4" Typo="Typo.h2">OSDC Earth Magnetic Field</MudText>
<MudDivider Class="mb-4" />
<MudText Class="mx-6 px-6" Typo="Typo.body1">
    This stateless microservice evaluates WMM2025 and IGRF14 at WGS84 positions and UTC instants. Public latitude and
    longitude values are SI radians; depth is SI metres positive downward from the WGS84 ellipsoid. Magnetic results
    use a north-east-down frame and SI teslas, while the web interface can display practical engineering units through
    the OSDC unit-reference system.
</MudText>
